[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0241","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0241.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0267","title":"Cisco Catalyst 使能密码旁路漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst 交换机 5.4.x 版本存在认证绕过漏洞，本地攻击者可在未提供正确密码的情况下，通过特制操作绕过认证直接获取设备的 enable 特权模式访问权限，从而完全控制目标交换机。该漏洞影响 Cisco Catalyst 系列交换机运行的 5.4.x 版本固件，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。建议升级受影响的固件版本或配置严格的访问控制列表以缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0267"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:21.513","remediation":"升级 Cisco Catalyst 软件至 5.5 或更高版本，该版本修复了 enable 密码验证绕过漏洞。如无法升级，请在全局配置模式下使用 `enable secret` 命令设置加密密码替代 `enable password`，并配置 AAA 认证（`aaa new-model` + `aaa authentication enable default group tacacs+ enable`）以强制要求密码验证。同时限制管理接口的访问 IP 范围（`access-class` 或 ACL）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/catos-enable-bypass-pub.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1288","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1122","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0267.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0267.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0267","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0267.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0267.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mvjh-5wfv-gmqr/GHSA-mvjh-5wfv-gmqr.json","https://github.com/arpitn30/nipper-ng/blob/a344e58392d528c168b74ccda5caa309923fff56/0.11.10/common/report-vulns.c","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0267.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/ee86c26ee0202761283d7d612909ed4cc8981bf7/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0241.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0240","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0240.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0272","title":"RealNetworks RealServer 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealServer 存在输入验证不当漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器的 7070 端口发送特制的畸形数据，触发服务程序崩溃或资源耗尽，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 RealNetworks RealServer Pro 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。官方建议升级至受影响版本的最新补丁或限制对 7070 端口的访问以缓解风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0272"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:22.260","remediation":"建议立即升级至 RealServer 8.0 及以上版本（该版本修复了端口 7070 的畸形输入处理问题）。如无法升级，可在防火墙或主机层面限制对 TCP 7070 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接；或直接停用 RealServer 服务并迁移至替代流媒体服务器方案。对于已停止维护的旧版本，强烈建议彻底下线或隔离部署。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95625288231045&w=2","http://service.real.com/help/faq/servg270.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1128","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19856","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0272.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0272","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0272.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0272.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vj56-ggxg-589r/GHSA-vj56-ggxg-589r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d