X2800 M13 系列多路复用器，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0292"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-19T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:24.773","remediation":"建议在边界路由器或防火墙上配置 ICMP 速率限制（rate-limit），限制每秒入站 ICMP 包数量；同时配置 ACL 仅允许可信源 IP 访问 MX2800 的管理接口。如设备支持，升级到 Adtran 提供的最新固件版本。若无法升级，建议将 MX2800 置于独立管理 VLAN 中，避免直接暴露于不可信网络。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1129","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.10.10004190908140.32750-100000%40localhost.localdomain","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0292.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0292","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0292.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0292.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rcxx-v744-5g56/GHSA-rcxx-v744-5g56.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0292.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--b9727cde-58e7-4aa2-959a-bb9a30b977fe.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0282.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0231","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0231.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0257","title":"Novell NetWare 5.1 远程管理缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Novell NetWare 5.1 远程 Web 管理工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的超长 URL 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务拒绝或任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Novell NetWare 5.1 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，建议升级至最新版本或禁用远程 Web 管理功能。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0257"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-19T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:20.243","remediation":"升级到 Novell NetWare 5.1 Support Pack 1 (SP1) 或更高版本，该补丁已修复远程 Web 管理组件中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在服务器上停止 webadmin.nlm 和 webhttp.nlm 服务，或在网络边界防火墙阻断对 8008/TCP 和 8009/TCP 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1118","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0004171825340.10088-100000%40nimue.tpi.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19854","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0257.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0257","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0257.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0257.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w36g-w35g-jmxf/GHSA-w36g-w35g-jmxf.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0257.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0231.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0231.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0250","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0250.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0271","title":"GNU Emacs 密码历史记录未清除本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"GNU Emacs 20 版本的 `read-passwd` 等 Lisp 函数在处理密码输入后未能正确清除最近按键历史记录，导致本地攻击者可通过读取按键历史缓冲区获取未加密的明文密码。该漏洞影响 GNU Emacs 20 系列版本，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。建议升级至 Emacs 21 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0271"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:22.133","remediation":"升级到 GNU Emacs 21 及以上版本，该版本已修复 read-passwd 函数未清除历史按键缓冲区的问题。如无法升级，可在输入密码后手动执行 (clear-this-command-keys) 清除按键历史，或避免在多用户共享系统上使用 Emacs 的密码输入功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1125","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-04-15&msg=tg4s8zioxq.fsf%40mercury.rus.uni-stuttgart.de","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0271.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0271","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0271.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0271.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7mr4-hhph-pp56/GHSA-7mr4-hhph-pp56.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0271.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fe2ed06b-8f42-45aa-8a37-c96c4301eb76.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/eebf829d86861484c6ea731ef53f87c686c4f91c/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0250.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0248","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0248.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0270","title":"GNU Emacs 可预测临时文件名本地符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"GNU Emacs 20 中的 make-temp-name Lisp 函数在创建临时文件时使用可预测的文件名，本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击（symlink attack）在目标系统上实现文件劫持或信息窃听。该漏洞影响 GNU Emacs 20 及可能受影响的早期版本，攻击者需拥有本地用户权限，利用难度较低。建议升级至不受影响的版本或采用安全的临时文件创建方式。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0270"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:22.010","remediation":"升级到 Emacs 21.1 或更高版本（2001 年 10 月发布），该版本引入 make-temp-file 函数，该函数原子化创建临时文件，从根本上消除竞争条件。如无法升级，将所有 Elisp 代码中对 make-temp-name 的调用替换为 make-temp-file，并确保创建临时文件时使用 O_CREAT|O_EXCL 标志防止符号链接劫持。作为临时缓解措施，在系统层面配置 umask 077 避免其他用户访问临时目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1126","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-04-15&msg=tg4s8zioxq.fsf%40mercury.rus.uni-stuttgart.de","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0270.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0270","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0270.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0270.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-83rm-6fqr-j4q7/GHSA-83rm-6fqr-j4q7.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0270.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1125/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5359ec99-96f5-44d1-8e28-691be2dd9047.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0248.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0245","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0245.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0269","title":"GNU Emacs 20 从属PTY设备权限设置不当导致本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"GNU Emacs 20 在启动子进程时未能正确设置从属 PTY 设备的权限，导致本地攻击者可利用该漏洞读取或修改 Emacs 与子进程之间的通信内容。该漏洞影响 Emacs 20 系列版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。建议用户升级至最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0269"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-04-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:21.877","remediation":"建议升级到 GNU Emacs 20.7 或更高版本（如 Emacs 21.1 及以上），这些版本已修复 PTY 权限设置缺陷。若暂时无法升级，可通过设置 /dev/ptmx 权限为 600 或限制普通用户访问 PTY 设备作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快升级至受支持的 Emacs 版本（如 28.x 或 29.x）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1125","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-04-15&msg=tg4s8zioxq.fsf%40mercury.rus.uni-stuttgart.de","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0269.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0269","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0269.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0269.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j2cr-8pw5-rpvq/GHSA-j2cr-8pw5-rpvq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0269.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6a1643ae-483e-40ad-b0a7-710021ff3bd4.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f9648a93cda37545740a15294a2d605e6f32fa20/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0245.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0069","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0083","title":"HP HP-UX asecure 音频安全文件权限设置不当漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统中的 asecure 工具在创建音频安全配置文件 audio.sec 时，未正确设置文件权限，导致该文件权限配置不当。本地攻击者利用此漏洞可读取或修改 audio.sec 文件，造成拒绝服务或获取额外系统权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 系统，需拥有本地访问权限才能利用，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0083"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:57.903","remediation":"立即为 HP-UX 系统安装 HP 安全公告 HPSBUX0002-109 中对应的 asecure 补丁。临时缓解措施：以 root 权限执行 `chmod 600 /etc/audio.sec` 限制音频安全文件仅 root 可读写，并移除不必要的 audio 子系统 SUID 权限 (`chmod -s /usr/sbin/asecure`)。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2031","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0083.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0083","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0083.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0083.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ab96f9177ee90a5f19d09110efe1f64b34e91053/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x6g9-pg8p-c822/GHSA-x6g9-pg8p-c822.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2001/CVE-2001-0607.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--831d058a-08bd-4084-93af-235f5a790eeb.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fb522a8b91ce9f7aefbdbbac6f22e68bc83ef631/2000/CVE-2000-0083.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0239","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0239.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0266","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 跨框架安全策略绕过漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.01 存在跨框架安全策略绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 Java 小程序，利用 JSObject 接口修改 DOM 属性，将 IFRAME 元素的 src 属性设置为任意 JavaScript URL，从而绕过浏览器的跨框架安全限制，可能导致受影响用户浏览器中的敏感信息泄露。攻击者需诱使用户访问包含恶意小程序的网页。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0266"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-04-18","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Internet Explorer 至 5.5 或更高版本，或在浏览器安全设置中禁用 Java 小程序支持（工具 → Internet 选项 → 安全 → 自定义级别 → 禁用 Java 小程序脚本），以阻止恶意 applet 利用 JSObject 绕过跨域安全策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1121","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=38FC6130.D6D178FD%40nat.bg"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0239.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0237","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0237.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0264","title":"Panda Security 3.0 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Panda Security 3.0 存在安全绕过漏洞。当软件禁用注册表编辑功能后，本地用户仍可通过直接执行 .reg 注册表文件或使用其他未授权方法绕过此限制，从而修改系统注册表并获取更高权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要本地访问权限，影响系统的完整性。Panda Security 3.0 用户受此漏洞影响。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0264"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-04-17T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:21.143","remediation":"Panda Security 3.0 已停止技术支持，建议立即升级到受支持的 Panda Security 最新版本。如无法升级，可通过组策略或注册表禁用 .reg 文件的默认关联执行（将 HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\.reg 的默认值改为 txtfile），并限制用户对注册表编辑器的访问权限（设置 HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Policies\\System 下 DisableRegistryTools=1），同时移除用户对注册表文件的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://updates.pandasoftware.com/docs/us/Avoidvulnerability.zip","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1119","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=38FB45F2.550EA000%40teleline.es","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19855","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0264.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0264","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0264.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0264.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2322-3mhq-32v4/GHSA-2322-3mhq-32v4.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0264.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001294.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0237.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0237.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0237.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0238","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0238.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0265","title":"Panda Security 3.0 安全软件可被任意卸载漏洞","description":"Panda Security 3.0 存在安全配置缺陷，本地用户可通过 Windows 系统自带的「添加/删除程序」控制面板直接卸载该安全软件，无需管理员权限验证。攻击者在获得系统本地访问权限后，可利用此漏洞轻松移除防病毒防护，使目标系统暴露于恶意软件感染风险之下，为后续安装后门、木马等恶意程序创造有利条件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0265"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-04-17","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Panda Security 至 3.0 以上版本（如 Platinum 或 Global 版），这些版本在卸载时要求输入管理员密码。如无法升级，可通过组策略或注册表禁用普通用户的「添加/删除程序」权限，防止非授权卸载杀毒软件。同时开启 Windows 审核策略，监控 msiexec 卸载行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://updates.pandasoftware.com/docs/us/Avoidvulnerability.zip","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1119","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=38FB45F2.550EA000%40teleline.es"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0238.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0281","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0281.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0291","title":"StarDivision StarOffice 5.1 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"StarOffice 5.1 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过在文档中嵌入超长URL触发缓冲区溢出，导致应用程序崩溃并造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 StarOffice 5.1 版本，攻击条件为诱使用户打开包含恶意URL的特制文档，无法远程直接利用。建议用户避免打开来源不明的文档或升级到更高版本以规避风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0291"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:24.650","remediation":"建议升级至 StarOffice 5.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复此缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 StarOffice 已停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache OpenOffice 或 LibreOffice 等持续更新的办公套件。临时缓解措施：避免打开来源不明的文档，尤其是包含超长 URL 链接的文档。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0077.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1112","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0291.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0291","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0291.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0291.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-585v-cj86-hmjj/GHSA-585v-cj86-hmjj.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1112/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0291.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--45d319e2-ff59-43e0-b408-302876e9eced.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/1e58254e5bdaf937b4bd41c6a50d0d633bef0eb7/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0281.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0273","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0273.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0285","title":"XFree86 X11R6 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"XFree86 3.3.x 的 -xkbmap 参数处理存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可向该参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而以目标系统当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 XFree86 3.3.x 系列版本，需本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议升级至不受影响的 XFree86 版本或应用厂商提供的补丁进行修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0285"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:23.867","remediation":"升级 XFree86 至 4.0 及以上版本，该版本已修复 xkbmap 参数长度检查不足的问题。由于 XFree86 已停止维护，建议迁移至 X.Org Server（X11R7.x 系列）。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户登录权限，仅允许可信用户访问图形界面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0076.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1306","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0285.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0285","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0285.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0285.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-989m-9h73-8xcc/GHSA-989m-9h73-8xcc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0285.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001292.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f9648a93cda37545740a15294a2d605e6f32fa20/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0273.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0236","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0236.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0263","title":"Red Hat Linux 6.x X Font Server 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.x 系统中的 X Font Server (xfs) 组件在处理畸形请求时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 xfs 服务发送特制的恶意请求触发该漏洞，导致 xfs 服务进程崩溃进而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0263"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:21.020","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Linux 至 7.x 或更高版本，或安装 Red Hat 官方提供的 xfs 补丁包。如无法升级，可停止 xfs 服务（`service xfs stop && chkconfig xfs off`）并在防火墙中禁用 TCP 端口 7100 以阻断外部访问。对于仍在使用 RHEL 6 的系统，建议迁移至受支持的 RHEL 7/8/9 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0079.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1111","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0263.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0263","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0263.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0263.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fjx2-c7c3-8w5j/GHSA-fjx2-c7c3-8w5j.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1111/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0263.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--df86b5a3-4715-4230-9e82-a029e91666eb.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0236.toml"}]